Incident records (Toronto Police Service Community Safety Indicators) and
City of Toronto neighbourhood boundaries are open civic data:

  Contains information licensed under the Open Government Licence – Toronto.
  https://open.toronto.ca/open-data-licence/

Population estimates, Crime Severity Index, and CMA crime-rate tables remain
under the Statistics Canada Open Licence
(https://www.statcan.gc.ca/en/reference/licence). Keep the attributions already
in those files, of the form:

  Source: Statistics Canada, Table ….

This project is not an official product of Toronto Police Service, the City
of Toronto, or Statistics Canada.
